# 📔 Accunest

> A premium, enterprise-grade invoicing, inventory management, and digital accounting suite custom-tailored for Indian businesses. Formulated with state-of-the-art architectures, modern design tokens, high-fidelity micro-animations, and strict GST validation systems.

---

## 🛠️ The Tech Stack

### Frontend Architecture
* **Core**: [React 19](https://react.dev/) & [Next.js 16 (App Router)](https://nextjs.org/) for highly optimized Server-Side Rendering (SSR) and client navigation.
* **State Management**: [Zustand](https://github.com/pmndrs/zustand) for sleek, lightweight, reactive store configurations.
* **Async Cache**: [TanStack React Query v5](https://tanstack.com/query/latest) for high-performance server state query and mutations synchronization.
* **Styling**: [TailwindCSS v4](https://tailwindcss.com/) with Vanilla PostCSS for custom modern UI elements, HSL color tokens, and complete responsive control.
* **Micro-Animations**: [Framer Motion](https://www.framer.com/motion/) for fluid page entries, sidebars, interactive hover cards, and seamless UI transitions.

### Backend Infrastructure
* **Core Runtime**: [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) & [Express.js v5](https://expressjs.com/) for reliable RESTful services.
* **Language**: [TypeScript](https://www.typescriptlang.org/) for compile-time safety and strict interface enforcement across frontend and backend boundaries.
* **Database**: [MongoDB](https://www.mongodb.com/) via [Mongoose v9](https://mongoosejs.com/) for dynamic, high-performance schema serialization.
* **Utilities**:
  * **jsPDF & jsPDF-AutoTable** for professional, customizable client PDF invoice/receipt generations.
  * **SheetJS (XLSX)** for fast, granular spreadsheet export workflows.
  * **Zod** for powerful, real-time client-to-server strict schema validators.
  * **Nodemailer** for automated customer communication and transaction notification templates.

